WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:01.500
- Power of Christ compels you!

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:02.423
- I (beep) your mother!

00:00:03.432 --> 00:00:05.290
- The power of Christ compels you!

00:00:05.290 --> 00:00:06.879
The power of Christ compels you!

00:00:06.879 --> 00:00:08.152
- Your mother's in Hell!

00:00:08.152 --> 00:00:10.240
- The power of Christ compels you!

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:12.061
The power of Christ compels you!

00:00:12.061 --> 00:00:13.628
- I'll suck your (beep)!

00:00:13.628 --> 00:00:14.816
Let me suck your (beep)!

00:00:14.816 --> 00:00:18.104
Mother (beep)!

00:00:18.104 --> 00:00:20.854
(demon growling)

00:00:22.930 --> 00:00:24.630
- Could you please clear the room?

00:00:30.575 --> 00:00:33.492
(airships zooming)

00:00:41.910 --> 00:00:43.770
- Gotta be careful here.

00:00:43.770 --> 00:00:45.420
This place is crawling with them.

00:00:47.250 --> 00:00:48.083
What was that?

00:00:48.083 --> 00:00:49.350
- What?

00:00:49.350 --> 00:00:50.183
- Cover me.

00:00:56.760 --> 00:00:57.933
- Guys! Hey guys!

00:00:58.800 --> 00:00:59.970
Hey guys!

00:00:59.970 --> 00:01:00.870
Oh, thank God.

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:04.170
Hey, we started a community of survivors.

00:01:04.170 --> 00:01:05.370
Y'all come live with us!

00:01:06.252 --> 00:01:07.512
(cocks gun)

00:01:07.512 --> 00:01:09.762
(gunshots)

00:01:14.254 --> 00:01:17.587
(machine powering down)

00:01:18.720 --> 00:01:19.970
- Wait, how did you know?

00:01:21.570 --> 00:01:22.830
- Come on.

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:25.920
Redneck wants us to
move into his community?

00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:27.030
Us?

00:01:27.030 --> 00:01:27.863
Let's go.

00:01:36.719 --> 00:01:37.826
- Over here!

00:01:37.826 --> 00:01:39.933
Oh thank God, there are others!

00:01:40.980 --> 00:01:42.708
- Would you let me date your daughter?

00:01:42.708 --> 00:01:43.541
- Of course!

00:01:43.541 --> 00:01:45.791
(gunshots)

00:01:49.468 --> 00:01:51.159
- [Woman] Oh my God! Oh my
God! Oh my God! Oh my God!

00:01:51.159 --> 00:01:52.217
(woman screams)

00:01:52.217 --> 00:01:53.050
- Please don't hurt me!

00:01:53.050 --> 00:01:54.840
Uh, uh... My best friend's black

00:01:54.840 --> 00:01:56.430
and I love Jay-Z

00:01:56.430 --> 00:01:59.043
and, uh, my favorite
movie is Think Like a Man!

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:01.853
- She's good.

00:02:01.853 --> 00:02:02.880
- Come with us.

00:02:02.880 --> 00:02:04.080
Stay close.

00:02:04.080 --> 00:02:04.913
What's your name?

00:02:04.913 --> 00:02:05.746
- Emily.

00:02:05.746 --> 00:02:06.828
- Of course it is.

00:02:06.828 --> 00:02:10.411
(suspenseful techno music)

00:02:14.208 --> 00:02:15.041
- Hey hey hey!

00:02:15.041 --> 00:02:17.124
Don't shoot! Don't shoot!

00:02:18.360 --> 00:02:20.820
- What do you think about the police?

00:02:20.820 --> 00:02:22.086
- Well, I love their third album.

00:02:22.086 --> 00:02:24.336
(gunshots)

00:02:25.868 --> 00:02:26.988
(old man screams)

00:02:26.988 --> 00:02:29.070
- I- I- I don't have any money!

00:02:29.070 --> 00:02:30.577
I've no money!

00:02:30.577 --> 00:02:33.410
(old man screams)

00:02:34.410 --> 00:02:37.243
(old man screams)

00:02:42.447 --> 00:02:43.440
- Oh my God! Oh my God!

00:02:43.440 --> 00:02:44.610
Thank God you guys showed up.

00:02:44.610 --> 00:02:45.873
I gotta get outta here.

00:02:46.950 --> 00:02:48.360
It's a silver Lexus.

00:02:48.360 --> 00:02:50.100
Just pull it right up front,

00:02:50.100 --> 00:02:51.630
and don't scuff the paint. All right?

00:02:51.630 --> 00:02:52.807
I just had it buffed.

00:02:52.807 --> 00:02:54.995
(key jingling)

00:02:54.995 --> 00:02:57.162
(gunshot)

00:03:04.860 --> 00:03:06.090
- Was he a alien too?

00:03:06.090 --> 00:03:06.923
- Yep.

00:03:14.370 --> 00:03:15.900
- Oh no, please don't say anything.

00:03:15.900 --> 00:03:17.676
Please just keep it to
yourself, whatever it is-

00:03:17.676 --> 00:03:19.560
(Levi sneezes)

00:03:19.560 --> 00:03:21.210
- Oh.

00:03:21.210 --> 00:03:22.560
Thought you had an idea.

00:03:22.560 --> 00:03:23.492
- I do.

00:03:23.492 --> 00:03:25.260
- (beep)

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:27.990
- We need to make an app...

00:03:27.990 --> 00:03:29.460
- Like for a smartphone?

00:03:29.460 --> 00:03:32.130
- An app that all the
people could download

00:03:32.130 --> 00:03:33.930
and then we make millions.

00:03:33.930 --> 00:03:35.700
- This (beep) is hard
to come up with, man.

00:03:35.700 --> 00:03:37.710
It's like catching lightning in a bottle.

00:03:37.710 --> 00:03:38.985
- I already got that.

00:03:38.985 --> 00:03:40.566
- You got what?

00:03:40.566 --> 00:03:42.390
- Lightning in a bottle.

00:03:42.390 --> 00:03:43.595
- Really? What's the idea?

00:03:43.595 --> 00:03:45.630
- No, no "idea".

00:03:45.630 --> 00:03:48.750
I got actual lightning in a bottle.

00:03:48.750 --> 00:03:49.756
- No, Le-Levi.

00:03:49.756 --> 00:03:51.453
That's just a phrase.

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:54.040
- I got that though.

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:55.290
(electricity buzzing)

00:03:55.290 --> 00:03:57.180
Lightning in a bottle. Bloop.

00:03:57.180 --> 00:03:58.440
- That's crazy, son!

00:03:58.440 --> 00:03:59.273
Where'd you get that?

00:03:59.273 --> 00:04:02.343
- Some old Chinese man
sold it to me years ago.

00:04:03.180 --> 00:04:05.460
- I mean that's some
supernatural (beep) man.

00:04:05.460 --> 00:04:08.067
- Nah, man. All it does is this.

00:04:08.067 --> 00:04:11.817
(electricity loudly zapping)

00:04:12.755 --> 00:04:13.672
- I got it.

00:04:15.360 --> 00:04:17.180
But seriously man...

00:04:18.750 --> 00:04:20.700
would it be like a app that reminds

00:04:20.700 --> 00:04:23.070
you when your favorite
television shows are on?

00:04:23.070 --> 00:04:24.534
- No!

00:04:24.534 --> 00:04:27.813
We gotta address this crazy
ass bottle that you got!

00:04:28.961 --> 00:04:30.710
- What bottle?

00:04:30.710 --> 00:04:32.583
- (bleep), what bottle?

00:04:33.930 --> 00:04:35.699
The bottle...

00:04:35.699 --> 00:04:37.083
with the lightning in it!

00:04:38.250 --> 00:04:40.200
- You still on that?

00:04:40.200 --> 00:04:41.490
- Yes.

00:04:41.490 --> 00:04:42.390
How does it work?

00:04:42.390 --> 00:04:44.100
- Cedric, I don't know.

00:04:44.100 --> 00:04:46.710
It's the classic lightning
in the bottle gag.

00:04:46.710 --> 00:04:48.210
- Classic light...

00:04:48.210 --> 00:04:49.459
- You just open it up...

00:04:49.459 --> 00:04:51.832
(electricity loudly zapping)

00:04:51.832 --> 00:04:54.749
(Cedric screaming)

00:04:57.120 --> 00:04:58.440
- Okay. You know what?

00:04:58.440 --> 00:04:59.920
You shouldn't have this.

00:04:59.920 --> 00:05:02.730
This (beep) belongs to
the military or something.

00:05:02.730 --> 00:05:03.810
- But that app though...

00:05:03.810 --> 00:05:05.640
- No, we don't need the app.

00:05:05.640 --> 00:05:08.730
You've got the goose
that laid the golden egg.

00:05:08.730 --> 00:05:10.353
- How do you know about Honkers?

00:05:12.420 --> 00:05:13.380
- What?

00:05:13.380 --> 00:05:14.672
This mother...

00:05:14.672 --> 00:05:15.505
(Honkers honks)

00:05:15.505 --> 00:05:18.084
- Honkers, get in on this app idea.

00:05:18.084 --> 00:05:18.990
(Honkers honks)

00:05:18.990 --> 00:05:19.917
- You like it?

00:05:19.917 --> 00:05:20.750
(Honkers honks)

00:05:20.750 --> 00:05:22.530
- He likes it.

00:05:22.530 --> 00:05:25.860
- Yep, he got a goddamn golden egg.

00:05:25.860 --> 00:05:28.893
- Honkers here is the cat's pajamas.

00:05:31.020 --> 00:05:32.160
- No, please don't. Don't-

00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:33.240
- I want to show you something.

00:05:33.240 --> 00:05:34.680
- Whatever it is, I don't want to see it.

00:05:34.680 --> 00:05:35.572
- It's relevant.

00:05:35.572 --> 00:05:37.412
- I already know what it is.

00:05:37.412 --> 00:05:38.823
- It ain't what you think.

00:05:41.430 --> 00:05:42.720
- Well, what I think it is

00:05:42.720 --> 00:05:44.763
is a pair of cats pajamas.

00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:47.553
- These are for Honkers to wear.

00:05:47.553 --> 00:05:48.633
- (beep) what?

00:05:50.010 --> 00:05:51.510
- The little neck in there.

00:05:51.510 --> 00:05:52.590
- The neck?

00:05:52.590 --> 00:05:54.900
How you going to fit his head

00:05:54.900 --> 00:05:57.743
through this the- with the
the orange hump (beep)?

00:05:58.585 --> 00:06:01.863
(Honkers honks)

00:06:01.863 --> 00:06:04.163
- I'm gonna have to ask
you to leave my house.

00:06:05.190 --> 00:06:06.023
- Why?

00:06:06.023 --> 00:06:10.124
- Because you disrespected my roommate.

00:06:10.124 --> 00:06:11.130
(Cedric inhales)

00:06:11.130 --> 00:06:12.600
- Okay.

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:15.180
Okay. It's clear that
this is a crazy house,

00:06:15.180 --> 00:06:16.050
so I gotta go.

00:06:16.050 --> 00:06:17.550
You over here talking about geese

00:06:17.550 --> 00:06:19.785
and golden eggs and feline sleepwear.

00:06:19.785 --> 00:06:21.180
(Honkers honks)

00:06:21.180 --> 00:06:22.013
- C'mon man,

00:06:22.013 --> 00:06:25.473
Cedric, you need to get
off your high horse man.

00:06:27.000 --> 00:06:28.900
Hey, I just thought of a name for you.

00:06:33.150 --> 00:06:34.970
High Horse.

00:06:34.970 --> 00:06:37.970
(High Horse neighs)

00:06:39.090 --> 00:06:40.740
- Moving out?

00:06:40.740 --> 00:06:43.950
Please, this is the worst possible time.

00:06:43.950 --> 00:06:45.960
Please don't do this.

00:06:45.960 --> 00:06:46.793
Babe?

00:06:51.960 --> 00:06:53.160
- [Stan] Garbage!

00:06:53.160 --> 00:06:54.720
- Huh?

00:06:54.720 --> 00:06:56.310
- Can I take your garbage?

00:06:56.310 --> 00:06:57.143
- Yeah, sure.

00:06:58.478 --> 00:07:00.690
(Stan laughs)

00:07:00.690 --> 00:07:04.930
- You know, I find the
more garbage in the can

00:07:06.300 --> 00:07:08.583
the better it feels to dump it all out.

00:07:11.460 --> 00:07:12.660
I suppose that's why

00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:15.260
we let it get so full
in the first place...

00:07:17.730 --> 00:07:19.568
So we can start over.

00:07:19.568 --> 00:07:21.487
(Stan snaps)

00:07:21.487 --> 00:07:25.200
(mystic bells ringing)

00:07:25.200 --> 00:07:26.850
- Here to fix the copier.

00:07:26.850 --> 00:07:28.620
- Yeah. Sure, sure.

00:07:28.620 --> 00:07:29.453
- Hey, how did you-

00:07:29.453 --> 00:07:33.210
- Sometimes things ain't really broken,

00:07:33.210 --> 00:07:35.250
it's the way we treat 'em

00:07:35.250 --> 00:07:37.047
that needs to be fixed.

00:07:37.047 --> 00:07:38.637
(mystical ringing)

00:07:38.637 --> 00:07:41.888
(copier whirring)

00:07:41.888 --> 00:07:43.379
(Carl whistles)

00:07:43.379 --> 00:07:45.697
(bird tweets)

00:07:45.697 --> 00:07:48.197
(Carl laughs)

00:07:51.120 --> 00:07:52.470
- Who the hell are you guys?

00:07:52.470 --> 00:07:56.193
- The important question
is, who are you Steve?

00:07:57.504 --> 00:08:00.300
(sudden suspenseful music)

00:08:00.300 --> 00:08:01.740
- Well,

00:08:01.740 --> 00:08:04.560
if it isn't Mr. Stan there.

00:08:04.560 --> 00:08:05.493
- Carl.

00:08:06.327 --> 00:08:09.660
(epic foreboding music)

00:08:11.756 --> 00:08:13.170
- You need to find

00:08:13.170 --> 00:08:15.273
your own troubled white boy.

00:08:21.390 --> 00:08:22.853
- I was here first.

00:08:26.857 --> 00:08:29.580
(epic music crescendos)

00:08:29.580 --> 00:08:30.413
- Copycat!

00:08:30.413 --> 00:08:32.727
(Carl coughs)

00:08:35.970 --> 00:08:38.345
- Sweep this!

00:08:38.345 --> 00:08:41.116
(Stan grunts)

00:08:41.116 --> 00:08:44.533
(Carl laughs maniacally)

00:08:45.675 --> 00:08:47.396
(Stan snaps)

00:08:47.396 --> 00:08:48.229
- Uh oh.

00:08:48.229 --> 00:08:49.277
(Stan shouts)

00:08:49.277 --> 00:08:50.869
(Carl grunts)

00:08:50.869 --> 00:08:53.369
(Stan laughs)

00:08:54.537 --> 00:08:56.495
(electrical buzzing)

00:08:56.495 --> 00:08:59.328
(papers flapping)

00:09:00.596 --> 00:09:03.846
(paper stars whirring)

00:09:06.454 --> 00:09:07.287
- Damn!

00:09:08.535 --> 00:09:09.593
Chesterfield!

00:09:09.593 --> 00:09:10.426
(Carl whistles)

00:09:10.426 --> 00:09:12.787
(eagles cries)

00:09:12.787 --> 00:09:15.480
- There can be only one...

00:09:15.480 --> 00:09:16.320
- Magical...

00:09:16.320 --> 00:09:17.153
- Negro!

00:09:19.728 --> 00:09:23.061
(epic music crescendos)

00:09:28.228 --> 00:09:31.061
(electrical buzzing)

00:09:31.061 --> 00:09:33.728
(laser buzzing)

00:09:34.740 --> 00:09:37.407
(Carl whistles)

00:09:38.982 --> 00:09:41.399
(both shout)

00:09:43.521 --> 00:09:46.410
(loud boom)

00:09:46.410 --> 00:09:48.993
(cars honking)

00:09:57.382 --> 00:09:58.382
- Good lord.

00:09:59.550 --> 00:10:01.050
Are you all right?

00:10:02.700 --> 00:10:03.533
Well,

00:10:04.380 --> 00:10:07.860
I guess sometimes things
have to come apart

00:10:07.860 --> 00:10:11.040
before we can put 'em back together again.

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:14.730
- Oh, you're a magical negro too!

00:10:14.730 --> 00:10:16.353
- Who you callin' negro, bitch?

